            <tr><td class="py-3 px-4 font-semibold text-navy">WTP-transitie-recall werkgevers</td><td class="py-3 px-4 text-slate-700 text-xs">Ja, deadline-monitoring + outreach</td><td class="py-3 px-4 text-slate-600 text-xs">Nee — geen client-portfolio context</td><td class="py-3 px-4 text-slate-600 text-xs">Handmatig, vaak gemist</td></tr>
